1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,040
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,240
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:05,110
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:08,880
(Episode 101)

5
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,520
Park Hyun Jun.

6
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:27,030
Park Hyun Jun!

7
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:30,140
You!

8
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,120
How...

9
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,120
Why would you do that?

10
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:49,590
Hyun Jun...

11
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:53,290
Not my Hyun Jun!

12
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:56,730
Song Geun Tae.

13
00:00:57,530 --> 00:00:59,300
Don't tell me it was you.

14
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,400
Park Tae Ho!

15
00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:09,540
Mr. Song!

16
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,640
Mr. Song...

17
00:01:12,310 --> 00:01:13,310
Park Tae Ho!

18
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:20,390
Mr. Song...

19
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,120
Mr. Song.

20
00:01:24,890 --> 00:01:26,590
Mr. Song...

21
00:01:31,030 --> 00:01:32,130
What is all this?

22
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,770
Blood?

23
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:36,300
Park Hyun Jun!

24
00:01:43,910 --> 00:01:45,980
Call an ambulance. Please call 911!

25
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,080
What? Oh, right.

26
00:01:48,150 --> 00:01:49,450
Where's Hyun Jun?

27
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:53,080
Hyun Jun, are you okay?

28
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:54,820
You're not hurt, are you?

29
00:01:56,450 --> 00:01:57,790
I'm okay.

30
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,890
Just hang in there.

31
00:02:00,930 --> 00:02:03,600
- Okay.
- Oh, right. Hello?

32
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,030
We're in the Adele parking lot.

33
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,270
- Yes, please hurry. Hurry!
- As long...

34
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,830
as you're okay...

35
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:16,610
I'm okay too.

36
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,810
Mr. Song!

37
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,480
Geun Tae!

38
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:25,720
What's going on? Come on.

39
00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:27,520
Hey, stay with me.

40
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:31,290
Stay with me. Mr. Song!

41
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:33,120
Mr. Song!

42
00:02:40,570 --> 00:02:45,540
(Operating Center)

43
00:02:51,810 --> 00:02:55,310
How could someone like you... How?

44
00:02:56,110 --> 00:02:59,820
How can I be your son? How?

45
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:03,050
Living a life like yours,
getting kicked around,

46
00:03:03,050 --> 00:03:04,660
is that what you call being fine?

47
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:18,900
(Operating Center)

48
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,880
What am I going to do?

49
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:37,320
I said so many
cruel and hurtful things to him.

50
00:03:41,990 --> 00:03:44,130
I never even got to say I was sorry.

51
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:54,440
I never even got to call him Father.

52
00:03:57,410 --> 00:03:58,410
Jin Ju.

53
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:01,810
What if this is how it ends?

54
00:04:02,650 --> 00:04:03,880
Mr. Song...

55
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:10,460
Your father will be fine.

56
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,220
You're here waiting for him,

57
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:16,090
so he'll pull through somehow.

58
00:04:49,660 --> 00:04:51,360
What are you doing out here?

59
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:53,700
If you want to hear the results
of the surgery,

60
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:55,800
you should wait in front
of the operating room.

61
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:59,070
Geun Tae...

62
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:02,240
I thought I wouldn't care
if he died.

63
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,280
There were even times...

64
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:07,280
I thought about killing him
with my own hands.

65
00:05:09,010 --> 00:05:10,010
But...

66
00:05:11,250 --> 00:05:12,280
Why...

67
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:15,190
Why do I feel this way?

68
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:21,260
Why am I shaking
and feeling so scared?

69
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,700
Because losing someone you love...

70
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:31,300
is as painful as having
your limbs torn off one by one.

71
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,540
First,

72
00:05:35,970 --> 00:05:38,240
the pain makes
your whole body tremble.

73
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:42,850
Then the hopelessness of having
to endure the future alone...

74
00:05:44,180 --> 00:05:45,650
is what frightens you.

75
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:50,020
When I lost my sister...

76
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:53,420
and when Min Jun had his accident,

77
00:05:55,130 --> 00:05:56,660
I felt the same way.

78
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,930
While I waited in front of the OR,

79
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:05,240
I was so terrified
my whole body was shaking.

80
00:06:05,870 --> 00:06:08,110
Oh Jung Ran, your sins...

81
00:06:10,010 --> 00:06:11,810
were that cruel.

82
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,800
I'm sorry.

83
00:06:52,650 --> 00:06:53,650
Now,

84
00:06:54,650 --> 00:06:56,590
you'll have to get used
to saying that.

85
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:15,540
Park Tae Ho didn't flee the country.

86
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:19,780
He stabbed someone and ran away.
We have to catch him immediately.

87
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:22,280
Of course.
We've already put out an APB,

88
00:07:22,350 --> 00:07:24,380
and we're tracking him
by analyzing CCTV footage,

89
00:07:24,450 --> 00:07:25,480
so don't worry.

90
00:07:25,550 --> 00:07:28,020
He could show up again
and do something dangerous,

91
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,320
so please tell everyone else
to be careful.

92
00:07:30,790 --> 00:07:31,790
Then...

93
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:33,260
Right.

94
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,060
Park Tae Ho...

95
00:07:40,430 --> 00:07:43,530
How many more people must he kill
before he stops?

96
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:47,310
He may never stop.
He's not going to stop here.

97
00:07:48,110 --> 00:07:51,580
For my mother and Jin Ju's sake,
we have to find him.

98
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:53,780
Of course.

99
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,980
Our intel team
is tracking him as well.

100
00:07:57,150 --> 00:07:58,420
I'm sure...

101
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:00,920
we'll find him.

102
00:08:09,990 --> 00:08:12,460
(Eunhwa Trading)

103
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:18,800
So his father was
that useless Driver Song?

104
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:22,940
And I raised him in my house
for 30 years without knowing?

105
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:26,840
Whatever. I wouldn't mind it...

106
00:08:27,350 --> 00:08:30,780
if that lowlife punk died
instead of Hyun Jun.

107
00:08:31,050 --> 00:08:33,620
How could you do something
so reckless without consulting me?

108
00:08:33,950 --> 00:08:36,190
You could be caught
if the police track you.

109
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,330
The preparations are complete.

110
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,000
Shall we begin?

111
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:05,180
They said your surgery
was a success,

112
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,290
so wake up soon.

113
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,650
Serves you right.

114
00:09:09,650 --> 00:09:12,720
Why would a coward like you
get involved?

115
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:14,990
Just look at the state you're in.

116
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:19,100
Why would you say something
you don't mean?

117
00:09:20,230 --> 00:09:21,700
"Wake up soon."

118
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:25,340
"Thank you for saving him."

119
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:29,270
Isn't that what you want to say?

120
00:09:32,210 --> 00:09:35,150
Why bother saying nice things
to a man just lying there?

121
00:09:36,050 --> 00:09:37,420
Just tell him to wake up already.

122
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:39,320
Once he wakes up,

123
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:43,820
I'll thank him
and tell him I'm sorry,

124
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,890
so he has to wake up to hear it.

125
00:10:03,710 --> 00:10:04,780
This time,

126
00:10:07,350 --> 00:10:08,950
I think Mom is right.

127
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:14,250
So please wake up soon.

128
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,420
Once you wake up...

129
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:22,390
Gosh, really...

130
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:26,030
I'll call you Father.

131
00:10:34,110 --> 00:10:35,140
Father.

132
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:56,130
Is Driver Song going
to be all right?

133
00:10:57,090 --> 00:11:00,330
They said the surgery went well,
so we just have to wait.

134
00:11:01,970 --> 00:11:03,170
I can't believe Park Tae Ho.

135
00:11:03,300 --> 00:11:05,770
How could he come out of hiding
just to stab someone?

136
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,910
I know the police are on it,

137
00:11:08,170 --> 00:11:09,710
but shouldn't we be doing
something, too?

138
00:11:09,770 --> 00:11:12,580
But we don't know
what he'll do next.

139
00:11:12,810 --> 00:11:15,550
The police told us to be careful
for the time being.

140
00:11:16,210 --> 00:11:17,350
Park Tae Ho.

141
00:11:17,650 --> 00:11:21,290
He lost all his stocks and assets,
so he should have nothing.

142
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:23,590
How is he hiding
and managing to stay on the run?

143
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:26,460
But did he really lose everything?

144
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:29,360
What if there's something
we don't know about?

145
00:11:31,830 --> 00:11:34,900
Can I see the list of assets
Park Tae Ho turned over?

146
00:11:35,430 --> 00:11:38,370
If something's missing,
the list could give us a clue.

147
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,400
Hyun Jun's lawyers have it.

148
00:11:40,470 --> 00:11:42,570
Then let's go check it out together.

149
00:11:42,810 --> 00:11:44,010
I'll go with you.

150
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:47,040
Jin Ju, you should stay
and check on things at the hospital.

151
00:11:47,110 --> 00:11:50,110
That's right. You should go see
Driver Song when he wakes up.

152
00:11:50,210 --> 00:11:51,650
I'll go with the others.

153
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:54,090
Then please let me know
if you find anything.

154
00:11:56,220 --> 00:11:57,690
- All right.
- Let's go.

155
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:01,630
- Be careful.
- Sure.

156
00:12:01,690 --> 00:12:02,690
We'll talk later.

157
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,840
Is it from the intel team?

158
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:21,010
Did they find something
on Park Tae Ho?

159
00:12:21,110 --> 00:12:22,410
It's not about Park Tae Ho.

160
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,420
It's about Choi Yu Na.

161
00:12:24,750 --> 00:12:25,950
Choi Yu Na?

162
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:28,020
She was arrested
and moved to a detention center,

163
00:12:28,650 --> 00:12:30,190
but she doesn't seem right.

164
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:32,920
She doesn't seem right?

165
00:12:53,710 --> 00:12:55,250
Oh, my baby.

166
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:59,780
Are you getting any sleep?

167
00:13:00,850 --> 00:13:03,190
You were moved from the holding cell
to the detention center,

168
00:13:04,090 --> 00:13:06,520
and in such a short time,
you've gotten so thin.

169
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:09,230
Mom, did you see the news?

170
00:13:09,830 --> 00:13:10,960
Chairman Park Tae Ho...

171
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:12,700
stabbed Driver Song.

172
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:15,470
They say he was aiming
for Park Hyun Jun.

173
00:13:17,370 --> 00:13:19,040
Where does that leave the wedding?

174
00:13:19,300 --> 00:13:21,270
I'm supposed to be
the chairman's daughter-in-law.

175
00:13:23,570 --> 00:13:24,910
Is Chairman Park Tae Ho...

176
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:26,780
ruining my wedding again?

177
00:13:27,140 --> 00:13:29,180
Oh, for goodness' sake.

178
00:13:29,250 --> 00:13:30,310
Yu Na.

179
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:32,320
What has gotten into you?

180
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,380
Park Tae Ho.

181
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:35,750
I won't let him get away with this.

182
00:13:36,450 --> 00:13:37,720
He killed Dad...

183
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:39,590
and didn't compensate me for it.

184
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:43,190
My life
and the compensation I deserve.

185
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:44,860
That man ruined it all.

186
00:13:44,930 --> 00:13:46,660
It's all Park Tae Ho's fault
I ended up like this.

187
00:13:46,730 --> 00:13:48,500
I'm going to kill him!

188
00:13:49,430 --> 00:13:52,440
Yu Na? Choi Yu Na!

189
00:13:57,910 --> 00:14:00,880
Wait. Mom, why am I here?

190
00:14:01,810 --> 00:14:03,850
I haven't done anything wrong.

191
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,290
Baek Jin Ju is the one at fault.

192
00:14:08,350 --> 00:14:10,390
She stole from me first.

193
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:14,530
My dreams, my position,
my man, everything.

194
00:14:15,690 --> 00:14:17,130
Why am I the only one
who has to lose everything?

195
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,000
Why can't I ever beat Baek Jin Ju?

196
00:14:20,730 --> 00:14:24,870
This is all her fault. Baek Jin Ju!

197
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,710
My gosh. Yu Na.

198
00:14:28,470 --> 00:14:31,140
How did you end up like this?

199
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:34,480
Sweetie, pull yourself together.

200
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:38,520
- Pull yourself together.
- No. It's okay.

201
00:14:38,950 --> 00:14:41,390
I just need to get out of here.
Right?

202
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,290
I'll get out.

203
00:14:43,850 --> 00:14:46,590
Oh, my baby. What am I going to do?

204
00:14:49,590 --> 00:14:52,700
Oh, Yu Na. My gosh.

205
00:14:59,570 --> 00:15:02,310
He still hasn't woken up.

206
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:06,510
They took him off the respirator
and said he's better,

207
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:09,450
so why is he still... Goodness.

208
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:12,950
Still, it's a relief
that he survived.

209
00:15:13,580 --> 00:15:17,250
Let's head back for today.
We need to help find Park Tae Ho.

210
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,320
Right.

211
00:15:18,690 --> 00:15:22,130
We have to catch that man
before he hurts someone else.

212
00:15:22,230 --> 00:15:23,230
Let's go.

213
00:15:24,430 --> 00:15:26,730
Why are you after Park Tae Ho?

214
00:15:36,570 --> 00:15:37,940
Mr. Yun.

215
00:15:38,110 --> 00:15:39,340
Are you awake?

216
00:15:40,540 --> 00:15:42,380
Where am I?

217
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:48,650
While I was unconscious,

218
00:15:49,350 --> 00:15:51,120
it seems a lot has happened.

219
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:55,790
In any case, I'm glad
you've woken up safely.

220
00:15:56,460 --> 00:15:57,630
Now that you're awake,

221
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:00,500
you should live
a different kind of life.

222
00:16:02,470 --> 00:16:03,700
A different kind of life?

223
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:06,870
So the people who prayed
for you to wake up don't regret it,

224
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:10,470
you need to take responsibility
for what you did wrong.

225
00:16:11,710 --> 00:16:13,510
You'll have to confess...

226
00:16:14,210 --> 00:16:16,350
and be punished for what you did
at Park Tae Ho's side.

227
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,780
The police will be here soon,

228
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:21,650
so cooperate with them.

229
00:16:22,250 --> 00:16:25,390
We're busy because of Park Tae Ho,
so we have to go now.

230
00:16:28,030 --> 00:16:29,130
Park Tae Ho...

231
00:16:30,590 --> 00:16:32,760
Has he tried to flee the country?

232
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:37,070
If he tries to flee the country,

233
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:40,470
there's only one place
that would help him.

234
00:16:43,070 --> 00:16:46,980
It's the same place
that helped Park Cheol Su escape.

235
00:16:47,610 --> 00:16:48,610
What?

236
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,320
It's Eunhwa Trading.

237
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:57,390
Deputy Chief Yun woke up
and told us.

238
00:16:57,650 --> 00:17:00,260
Eunhwa Trading helped
Park Cheol Su escape back then.

239
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:03,190
He said Park Tae Ho will turn
to them too.

240
00:17:03,690 --> 00:17:06,300
Actually, we were already suspicious
of Eunhwa Trading.

241
00:17:08,670 --> 00:17:10,530
Among the assets
that Park Tae Ho transferred,

242
00:17:10,770 --> 00:17:12,340
only the paintings were missing.

243
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:16,710
The paintings that were
in the Adele Gallery vault.

244
00:17:18,710 --> 00:17:22,010
The only place that would take
those paintings off his hands...

245
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,980
is Eunhwa Trading.

246
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,620
I'll go to Eunhwa Trading
and check it out.

247
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:29,090
Then we'll go
to the police station...

248
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:31,590
and tell them about Park Tae Ho
and Eunhwa Trading.

249
00:17:32,090 --> 00:17:33,090
Okay.

250
00:17:35,630 --> 00:17:37,690
- Did Deputy Chief Yun wake up?
- Yes.

251
00:17:37,690 --> 00:17:39,230
Well, that's a relief.

252
00:17:39,530 --> 00:17:40,800
Once we catch Park Tae Ho,

253
00:17:40,860 --> 00:17:42,770
we can call Deputy Chief Yun
as a witness.

254
00:17:42,770 --> 00:17:44,970
Let's head to Eunhwa Trading
before it's too late.

255
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:46,270
All right.

256
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,240
Hyun Jun.

257
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:59,580
How's Mr. Song?

258
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:01,350
He's still unconscious.

259
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:03,690
I'm sure he'll pull through safely.

260
00:18:04,590 --> 00:18:06,720
Yes, that he should.

261
00:18:07,190 --> 00:18:09,130
Where are you going in such a hurry?

262
00:18:09,730 --> 00:18:10,860
To Eunhwa Trading.

263
00:18:11,230 --> 00:18:14,300
We think they're helping
Park Tae Ho flee.

264
00:18:14,530 --> 00:18:15,570
What?

265
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:16,870
Are you sure?

266
00:18:16,930 --> 00:18:19,000
Deputy Chief Yun just woke up.

267
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:22,310
He said Eunhwa Trading
helped smuggle out Park Cheol Su,

268
00:18:22,470 --> 00:18:23,570
so we're going to check.

269
00:18:23,570 --> 00:18:24,880
Then I'm going with you.

270
00:18:27,910 --> 00:18:31,650
What if Park Tae Ho
comes after you again?

271
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:33,880
I won't fall for it
so easily this time.

272
00:18:34,250 --> 00:18:35,850
I'm going to be the one...

273
00:18:37,090 --> 00:18:38,560
who brings Park Tae Ho in.

274
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:42,360
I wonder who you take after.

275
00:18:43,130 --> 00:18:45,500
You never listen
to a single thing I say.

276
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:48,000
If you insist on going,

277
00:18:50,030 --> 00:18:51,640
be cautious of Eunhwa Trading's CEO.

278
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:54,440
That man is a businessman
to the bone,

279
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:55,610
and for decades,

280
00:18:55,870 --> 00:18:58,380
he's been on Park Tae Ho's side,
leeching off him.

281
00:18:59,340 --> 00:19:00,480
Whatever he says,

282
00:19:00,540 --> 00:19:02,880
don't be so quick to believe him
and think carefully.

283
00:19:03,050 --> 00:19:04,150
All right.

284
00:19:04,850 --> 00:19:05,850
Mom...

285
00:19:09,650 --> 00:19:11,290
You should stay by Father's side.

286
00:19:25,170 --> 00:19:26,370
Father?

287
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:43,020
What is this about?

288
00:19:43,090 --> 00:19:45,020
Where's Park Tae Ho right now?

289
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:47,290
Why ask me of all people?

290
00:19:48,430 --> 00:19:49,860
Tell us the truth.

291
00:19:50,130 --> 00:19:53,030
We already know
you're hiding Park Tae Ho.

292
00:19:54,830 --> 00:19:57,370
The paintings
from the Adele Gallery vault.

293
00:19:57,430 --> 00:19:58,670
He gave them to you, right?

294
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:01,940
Once the police
begin their investigation,

295
00:20:02,270 --> 00:20:05,680
all of your deals with Park Tae Ho
will be exposed.

296
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:09,450
If you hide him,
you'll be punished as well.

297
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:11,380
Wouldn't it be better
to cut your losses now?

298
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:16,790
He plans to flee the country
by ship tonight.

299
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:18,720
He should be meeting
the broker right now...

300
00:20:18,790 --> 00:20:20,060
to make preparations.

301
00:20:21,860 --> 00:20:23,030
Where exactly?

302
00:20:23,490 --> 00:20:25,130
The Adele Gallery vault.

303
00:20:25,460 --> 00:20:27,970
He's supposed to hand the paintings
over to the broker there...

304
00:20:28,530 --> 00:20:29,830
and finalize the deal.

305
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:33,200
Call the police right now
and let's go.

306
00:20:33,270 --> 00:20:35,410
I'll contact Jin Ju and James, too.

307
00:20:35,510 --> 00:20:37,570
Okay. Tell everyone
to meet us there.

308
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:42,550
(Eunhwa Trading)

309
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:48,420
Park Tae Ho!

310
00:20:56,030 --> 00:20:57,290
There's no one here.

311
00:20:58,130 --> 00:20:59,830
Were we one step too late?

312
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:01,870
Or...

313
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:11,840
Yes, this is Park Cheol Su.

314
00:21:12,810 --> 00:21:14,510
I installed it as you instructed,

315
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:16,480
and two people fell for the trap.

316
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:20,450
It'll go off while they're
running around searching,

317
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:22,520
so I'm going to leave first.

318
00:21:23,120 --> 00:21:24,120
Yes, sir.

319
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:35,870
(Eunhwa Trading)

320
00:21:35,930 --> 00:21:37,270
You're leaving anyway.

321
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:39,400
Do you really have to kill them all
before you go?

322
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:44,370
I can't leave without getting back
at the ones who did this to me.

323
00:21:44,470 --> 00:21:45,980
I'm going to gather them
in one place...

324
00:21:46,910 --> 00:21:48,450
and kill every last one of them.

325
00:21:49,050 --> 00:21:51,980
It's almost time to meet the broker.
We should go.

326
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:54,920
Wait.

327
00:21:56,090 --> 00:21:57,320
"Two people?"

328
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:00,720
Didn't he say
only two people were there?

329
00:22:01,690 --> 00:22:02,690
Why's that?

330
00:22:04,660 --> 00:22:06,200
Because we knew it was a trap.

331
00:22:30,320 --> 00:22:31,960
That's a bomb in there, isn't it?

332
00:22:32,820 --> 00:22:34,620
Disarm it right now...

333
00:22:34,890 --> 00:22:38,500
unless you want to die
with the rest of us.

334
00:22:43,930 --> 00:22:44,940
Darn it.

335
00:22:50,140 --> 00:22:53,510
So, Kim Dan Hui, it was you again?

336
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:57,080
You should've fallen into my trap
and died.

337
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:59,580
Why? How on earth did you know?

338
00:23:01,120 --> 00:23:04,790
Because I know how low a man
like Park Tae Ho can sink.

339
00:23:06,590 --> 00:23:08,230
You wouldn't be satisfied...

340
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:10,060
with just hurting Driver Song.

341
00:23:11,060 --> 00:23:14,970
If you could, you'd probably
want to kill all of us.

342
00:23:19,570 --> 00:23:20,740
And as for you...

343
00:23:23,140 --> 00:23:25,680
I thought it was weird
when you gave in so easily...

344
00:23:25,740 --> 00:23:27,710
just because I grabbed your collar.

345
00:23:28,410 --> 00:23:31,110
I spent 30 years constantly watching
my step around Park Tae Ho!

346
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:35,020
Park Tae Ho, it's all over now.

347
00:23:35,690 --> 00:23:37,420
The police are on their way,

348
00:23:37,890 --> 00:23:40,620
so end it here, all right?

349
00:23:49,930 --> 00:23:52,840
Of course. It had to be Kim Dan Hui.

350
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:56,010
You anticipated my plan
and prepared for it?

351
00:23:56,510 --> 00:24:01,210
I admit, that's impressive.
But I know you too, Kim Dan Hui.

352
00:24:02,710 --> 00:24:03,710
What?

353
00:24:04,780 --> 00:24:05,780
Get in here!

354
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,490
What?

355
00:24:10,750 --> 00:24:13,520
Right. Did you really think
I'd do all this...

356
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:15,390
without a backup plan?

357
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:19,930
Keep this lot in here!

358
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:22,200
- What is this?
- Park Tae Ho.

359
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:24,500
- Let me go.
- Move!

360
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:25,840
- Hey.
- Move.

361
00:24:25,900 --> 00:24:26,900
Park Tae Ho!

362
00:24:27,970 --> 00:24:30,040
- Park Tae Ho.
- Unbelievable.

363
00:24:39,650 --> 00:24:40,650
Kim Dan Hui.

364
00:24:59,270 --> 00:25:00,340
Park Tae Ho.

365
00:25:01,270 --> 00:25:02,370
Kim Dan Hui, hey.

366
00:25:03,070 --> 00:25:04,980
Are you finally coming to?

367
00:25:08,010 --> 00:25:09,010
What happened?

368
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:12,650
There's still some time
before my ship gets here.

369
00:25:13,550 --> 00:25:16,050
In the meantime,
the police will be making a fuss,

370
00:25:16,520 --> 00:25:18,860
and other pests will start swarming.

371
00:25:20,060 --> 00:25:22,290
But thanks to you getting caught,

372
00:25:22,790 --> 00:25:23,790
I can take a breather.

373
00:25:25,060 --> 00:25:27,200
You're my hostage.

374
00:25:28,330 --> 00:25:29,330
What?

375
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:33,840
He took her hostage?

376
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:37,010
We got to safety
thanks to the police,

377
00:25:37,370 --> 00:25:38,640
but before they got there,

378
00:25:39,980 --> 00:25:42,180
it seems Kim Dan Hui was captured.

379
00:25:43,180 --> 00:25:45,850
She chased after Park Tae Ho.

380
00:25:47,050 --> 00:25:49,350
Park Tae Ho contacted the police...

381
00:25:49,420 --> 00:25:51,050
and said
if they chase him or interfere,

382
00:25:52,460 --> 00:25:54,090
he'll kill Ms. Kim.

383
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:56,760
Kill her?

384
00:25:59,130 --> 00:26:01,130
How could Park Tae Ho...

385
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:05,300
So, what are the police saying?

386
00:26:06,170 --> 00:26:07,800
Because he has a hostage,

387
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,940
they said they will proceed
with caution.

388
00:26:10,210 --> 00:26:12,810
That's how Park Tae Ho is trying
to buy time.

389
00:26:13,910 --> 00:26:16,550
Where is my mother now?
Are there any clues?

390
00:26:16,780 --> 00:26:17,780
Not yet.

391
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:19,750
Just wait a little longer.

392
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:21,890
The police are reinvestigating,

393
00:26:22,050 --> 00:26:24,690
and our intel team
is doing their best to find her.

394
00:26:26,390 --> 00:26:27,460
Min Jun, I'm so sorry.

395
00:26:28,220 --> 00:26:30,090
Those thugs grabbed hold of me,

396
00:26:31,490 --> 00:26:32,900
and that's why I lost Dan Hui.

397
00:26:35,130 --> 00:26:36,700
I can tell from your injuries...

398
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:39,440
that you were in danger too,
Secretary Jung.

399
00:26:39,670 --> 00:26:40,740
Don't blame yourself.

400
00:26:41,840 --> 00:26:43,340
My mother will be safe.

401
00:26:43,940 --> 00:26:46,010
Before Park Tae Ho can harm her,

402
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:47,910
we'll find her.

403
00:26:48,950 --> 00:26:50,080
Park Tae Ho...

404
00:26:52,120 --> 00:26:53,750
Where on earth is he hiding?

405
00:26:59,460 --> 00:27:01,320
Wait. Park Cheol Su.

406
00:27:04,790 --> 00:27:05,900
What about him?

407
00:27:06,430 --> 00:27:07,860
I thought he was already handed over
to the police.

408
00:27:08,370 --> 00:27:11,400
Park Tae Ho is being smuggled out
with the help of Eunhwa Trading.

409
00:27:11,970 --> 00:27:13,940
Park Cheol Su escaped the same way,

410
00:27:14,040 --> 00:27:15,840
so he'll know
where to board the ship.

411
00:27:16,540 --> 00:27:17,840
If we start searching
around there...

412
00:27:18,580 --> 00:27:19,580
Right.

413
00:27:19,840 --> 00:27:21,110
Since he has to board a ship,

414
00:27:21,180 --> 00:27:22,810
he must be hiding somewhere nearby.

415
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:27,680
Min Jun!

416
00:27:34,760 --> 00:27:35,760
One hour.

417
00:27:37,360 --> 00:27:40,360
In one hour,
I'll leave this country...

418
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:42,630
and start over.

419
00:27:44,230 --> 00:27:46,370
Thanks to the paintings
from the vault,

420
00:27:46,940 --> 00:27:48,540
I have plenty of money.

421
00:27:48,970 --> 00:27:50,440
I can easily...

422
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,280
start over.

423
00:27:54,380 --> 00:27:55,450
No.

424
00:27:57,010 --> 00:27:58,450
No matter where you go
or what you do,

425
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,020
you'll just fail again in the end.

426
00:28:01,180 --> 00:28:02,420
As if.

427
00:28:02,450 --> 00:28:05,120
I, Park Tae Ho,
don't go down easily.

428
00:28:07,490 --> 00:28:09,860
I was an orphan
abandoned by my parents,

429
00:28:10,490 --> 00:28:13,560
and I overcame
every kind of humiliation.

430
00:28:15,130 --> 00:28:17,200
I took a small jewelry shop
like Munhwadang...

431
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:19,870
and turned it
into a global corporation.

432
00:28:20,740 --> 00:28:23,770
I'll overcome this crisis as well...

433
00:28:26,310 --> 00:28:27,410
and be successful again.

434
00:28:28,510 --> 00:28:29,510
Success?

435
00:28:31,280 --> 00:28:33,320
You're nothing
but a failed fugitive.

436
00:28:33,950 --> 00:28:35,320
You threw away your chance...

437
00:28:35,420 --> 00:28:37,820
to have the founder of Munhwadang
as a father.

438
00:28:38,250 --> 00:28:41,120
You threw away the chance
to build a family with my sister...

439
00:28:42,260 --> 00:28:45,230
and to be a father to Min Jun.

440
00:28:47,030 --> 00:28:48,200
Like that,

441
00:28:49,430 --> 00:28:51,370
you threw away the chance to be...

442
00:28:52,340 --> 00:28:53,400
a decent human being,

443
00:28:53,900 --> 00:28:56,610
as well as the chance
to love, be loved,

444
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,940
and be happy.

445
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:03,780
No, that's not right.

446
00:29:04,310 --> 00:29:05,780
I didn't abandon them.

447
00:29:06,320 --> 00:29:07,320
They're the ones...

448
00:29:08,450 --> 00:29:10,320
who abandoned me.

449
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:14,920
My parents, my father-in-law,
and Kim Myung Hui!

450
00:29:16,890 --> 00:29:18,460
They all abandoned me.

451
00:29:21,060 --> 00:29:24,870
But still,
I gave you and Min Jun a chance.

452
00:29:25,670 --> 00:29:27,240
I let you live comfortably,

453
00:29:28,300 --> 00:29:29,770
and had hopes...

454
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:32,210
of maybe even becoming a family.

455
00:29:33,940 --> 00:29:36,550
But you two were ungrateful...

456
00:29:36,950 --> 00:29:39,950
and ended up betraying me.

457
00:29:40,180 --> 00:29:43,290
After killing, deceiving,
and using people,

458
00:29:44,690 --> 00:29:46,060
you expected us to become a family?

459
00:29:47,490 --> 00:29:49,830
You don't understand
what family means,

460
00:29:50,390 --> 00:29:52,260
and you don't know
how precious people are.

461
00:29:53,560 --> 00:29:55,530
You're nothing but a foolish
and pitiful man.

462
00:29:58,030 --> 00:30:01,640
You're the foolish and pitiful one,
Kim Dan Hui!

463
00:30:02,770 --> 00:30:05,440
You spent 30 years plotting revenge,

464
00:30:06,340 --> 00:30:08,480
only to be deceived that whole time.

465
00:30:09,910 --> 00:30:10,910
That's right.

466
00:30:12,820 --> 00:30:15,350
I was foolish to have been deceived
by someone like you.

467
00:30:16,750 --> 00:30:18,450
But at least, I...

468
00:30:20,020 --> 00:30:21,120
have a family...

469
00:30:21,930 --> 00:30:23,130
and people on my side.

470
00:30:25,130 --> 00:30:26,130
Mother!

471
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,400
Min Jun!

472
00:30:33,940 --> 00:30:35,210
How did you find us?

473
00:30:36,970 --> 00:30:39,810
Park Tae Ho.
How could you hurt Mother?

474
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:44,580
Right. You are my only bloodline...

475
00:30:44,610 --> 00:30:46,080
and my only son.

476
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:51,320
Losing you because of Kim Dan Hui?

477
00:30:52,320 --> 00:30:53,320
That's painful.

478
00:30:54,760 --> 00:30:58,760
No, it's not because of Mother.
It's because of you.

479
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:02,130
From the moment you strangled
the mother who gave birth to me,

480
00:31:03,430 --> 00:31:05,200
I was no longer your son.

481
00:31:08,270 --> 00:31:09,270
Fine!

482
00:31:10,210 --> 00:31:12,710
The fact that you
take after Myung Hui.

483
00:31:13,180 --> 00:31:14,880
That was the problem.

484
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:19,750
It's a good thing
he isn't like a beast like you.

485
00:31:20,180 --> 00:31:22,250
What? What was that?

486
00:31:22,550 --> 00:31:23,920
What did you just say?

487
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:25,120
What was that?

488
00:31:28,590 --> 00:31:31,090
- Min Jun.
- Mother, are you okay?

489
00:31:31,730 --> 00:31:32,730
Min Jun...

490
00:31:40,340 --> 00:31:41,340
Mother.

491
00:31:45,510 --> 00:31:46,510
Min Jun!

492
00:31:50,710 --> 00:31:51,880
Before I go,

493
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:54,950
I'm going to kill you
with my own hands, Kim Dan Hui.

494
00:31:57,490 --> 00:32:00,460
Everything went wrong
because of you.

495
00:32:01,320 --> 00:32:02,860
Because of you!

496
00:32:31,020 --> 00:32:33,020
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
